cinnamon is a computer task manager: see what is happening on your machine in real time.

Live process list with CPU and memory usage, safe kill and renice controls, SVG performance graphs, explainable local AI diagnostics, optional bring-your-own-key cloud AI, and watcher rules that alert on resource thresholds.

Includes in-app and GitHub changelogs. No account required.

To launch: Menu -> Office -> cinnamon
